							<span class="highlight-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M20 10c0 5-8 11-8 11S4 15 4 10a8 8 0 1 1 16 0Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2.5"/></svg></span>
							<div class="highlight-content"><p class="highlight-label">Location</p><p class="highlight-value">Macedonia</p><p class="highlight-detail">Based in the Balkans</p></div>
						</article>
						<article class="highlight-card highlight-card--experience">
							<span class="highlight-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16"/><path d="m7 15 4-4 3 2 5-6"/><path d="M16 7h3v3"/></svg></span>
							<div class="highlight-content"><p class="highlight-label">Experience</p><p class="highlight-value">4+ years</p><p class="highlight-detail">Professional engineering</p></div>
						</article>
					</section>

					<section class="hero-about" aria-labelledby="hero-about-title">
						<h2 id="hero-about-title" class="section-heading"><span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="m12 3 1.5 3M21 12l-3 1.5M12 21l-1.5-3M3 12l3-1.5"/></svg></span>Goal</h2>
						<p>Design software that pushes hardware to its full potential without sacrificing usability or maintainability. I enjoy solving complex engineering challenges, learning new technologies, and building applications that are both technically robust and practical for real-world use.</p>
					</section>

