								<dt><span class="skill-label-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="m8 9-3 3 3 3M16 9l3 3-3 3M14 5l-4 14"/></svg></span>Programming languages</dt>
								<dd><ul class="skill-pills"><li>C#</li><li>TypeScript</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>Python</li><li>SQL</li><li>Rust</li><li>Java</li></ul></dd>
							</div>
							<div class="skill-group skill-group--frameworks">
								<dt><span class="skill-label-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="m12 3 8 4.5-8 4.5-8-4.5L12 3Z"/><path d="m4 12 8 4.5 8-4.5M4 16.5 12 21l8-4.5"/></svg></span>Frameworks</dt>
								<dd><ul class="skill-pills"><li>ASP.NET Core</li><li>Entity Framework Core</li><li>Angular</li><li>React</li><li>Avalonia UI</li><li>Django</li><li>Express.js</li><li>Node.js</li></ul></dd>
							</div>
							<div class="skill-group skill-group--machine-learning">
								<dt><span class="skill-label-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="7" y="7" width="10" height="10" rx="1"/><path d="M9 1v3m6-3v3M9 20v3m6-3v3M1 9h3m-3 6h3m16-6h3m-3 6h3M10 10h4v4h-4z"/></svg></span>Machine learning &amp; high-performance computing</dt>
								<dd><ul class="skill-pills"><li>PyTorch</li><li>U-Net</li><li>ROCm/HIP</li><li>CUDA</li><li>Vulkan</li></ul></dd>
							</div>
						</dl>
					</section>

					<section class="hero-signals" aria-label="Professional highlights">
						<article class="signal-card signal-card--one"><p class="signal-label">Total projects</p><p class="signal-value">11</p></article>
						<article class="signal-card signal-card--two"><p class="signal-label">Currently working on</p><p class="signal-value" style="font-size: 16px;">Sezakompjuteri<br />Gluj-Lens <br />  DalMax Frigo</p> <br /></article>
						<article class="signal-card signal-card--three"><p class="signal-label">Current position</p><p class="signal-value" style="font-size: 16px;">Co-Founder of Sezakompjuteri &amp; Lead Software Engineer</p></article>
